* {{alt|nn|intj}} {{q|syncopated and palatalised form}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nn|gmq-mno|einki}}, from {{m|gmq-mno|eikki}} with ''-n-'' from {{m|nn|eingin}} (< {{der|nn|non|enginn}}, {{m|non|engi}}). Ultimately from {{inh|nn|non|ekki}}. Compare Swedish {{cog|sv|inte}}. 

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nn|/²ɪntə/}}, Eastern Norway
* {{IPA|nn|/²entə/}}, Østfold 
* {{IPA|nn|/²iɲce/}}, Røros

